[{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;-4\\\\0&amp;2&amp;-5\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Two of the eigenvalues of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with eigenvectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> respectively. A matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is diagonal and is defined such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the value of the third eigenvalue <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>By finding the eigenvector corresponding to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, determine a possible matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>By finding <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find a possible matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix} =\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\lambda&amp;0&amp;-4\\\\0&amp;2-\\lambda&amp;-5\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-3-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I) =(1-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)(-3-\\lambda)-0+0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(1-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)(-3-\\lambda) =0\\Rightarrow \\lambda_1=-3,\\;\\lambda_2=1\\text{ or }\\lambda_3=2,\\quad\\therefore \\lambda_3=2.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_3=2:\\quad\\mathbf A-2\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;0&amp;-4\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-5\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-5\\end{pmatrix},\\quad (\\mathbf A-2\\mathbf I)\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-x-4z =0\\Rightarrow x=-4z,\\qquad -5z=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nz =0\\text{ so that }x=z=0,\\qquad\\therefore\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P =\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\det\\mathbf P=\\begin{vmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\end{vmatrix}=-1(-1)+0-0=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\text{Cofactor matrix of }\\mathbf P =\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\therefore\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P =\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;-4\\\\0&amp;2&amp;-5\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;1&amp;0\\\\-3&amp;0&amp;2\\\\-3&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>For each of the following, by finding eigenvalues <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1&lt;\\lambda_2&lt;\\lambda_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and their respective eigenvectors to find a matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and using your calculator to find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, determine diagonal matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;1&amp;-5\\\\2&amp;3&amp;-4\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;3&amp;1\\\\1&amp;4&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix} =\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}5-\\lambda&amp;1&amp;-5\\\\2&amp;3-\\lambda&amp;-4\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-2-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I) =\\left|\\begin{matrix}5-\\lambda&amp;1&amp;-5\\\\2&amp;3-\\lambda&amp;-4\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-2-\\lambda\\end{matrix}\\right|=\\left|\\begin{matrix}5-\\lambda&amp;1&amp;-5\\\\0&amp;2-\\lambda&amp;-2+\\lambda\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-2-\\lambda\\end{matrix}\\right|\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left|\\begin{matrix}5-\\lambda&amp;1&amp;-4\\\\0&amp;2-\\lambda&amp;0\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-1-\\lambda\\end{matrix}\\right|=\\left|\\begin{matrix}3-\\lambda&amp;0&amp;-3+\\lambda\\\\0&amp;2-\\lambda&amp;0\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-1-\\lambda\\end{matrix}\\right|\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(3-\\lambda)((2-\\lambda)(-1-\\lambda))-2(-3+\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(3-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)(-1-\\lambda+2)=(3-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)(1-\\lambda).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(3-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)(1-\\lambda) =0\\Rightarrow\\lambda_1=1,\\lambda_2=2,\\lambda_3=3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_1=1:\\quad\\mathbf A-\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;1&amp;-5\\\\2&amp;2&amp;-4\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix},\\quad (\\mathbf A-\\mathbf I)\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n4x+y-5z =0\\;(1),\\quad2x+2y-4z=0\\;(2),\\quad2x+y-3z=0\\;(3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(1)-(2):\\quad2x-2z =0\\Rightarrow x=z,\\quad\\text{sub into (3): }y-x=0\\Rightarrow y=x,\\quad\\therefore\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_2=2:\\quad\\mathbf A-2\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;1&amp;-5\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-4\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-4\\end{pmatrix},\\quad (\\mathbf A-2\\mathbf I)\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3x+y-5z =0\\;(1),\\quad2x+y-4z=0\\;(2),\\quad2x+y-4z=0\\;(3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(1)-(2):\\quad x-z =0\\Rightarrow x=z,\\quad\\text{sub into (2): }y-2z=0\\Rightarrow y=2z,\\quad\\therefore\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_3=3:\\quad\\mathbf A-3\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1&amp;-5\\\\2&amp;0&amp;-4\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-5\\end{pmatrix},\\quad (\\mathbf A-3\\mathbf I)\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2x+y-5z =0\\;(1),\\quad2x-4z=0\\;(2),\\quad2x+y-5z=0\\;(3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(2):\\quad x-2z =0\\Rightarrow x=2z,\\quad\\text{sub into (1): }y-z=0\\Rightarrow y=z,\\quad\\therefore\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P =\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;2\\\\1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\1&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;-1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1&amp;-1\\\\1&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;-1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1&amp;-1\\\\1&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;1&amp;-5\\\\2&amp;3&amp;-4\\\\2&amp;1&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;2\\\\1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\1&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\therefore\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;2\\\\1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\1&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix} =\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\lambda&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;3-\\lambda&amp;1\\\\1&amp;4&amp;3-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I) =\\left|\\begin{matrix}1-\\lambda&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;3-\\lambda&amp;1\\\\1&amp;4&amp;3-\\lambda\\end{matrix}\\right|=\\left|\\begin{matrix}1-\\lambda&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;3-\\lambda&amp;1\\\\-1+2\\lambda&amp;0&amp;1-\\lambda\\end{matrix}\\right|\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\left|\\begin{matrix}1-\\lambda&amp;2&amp;1\\\\1+\\lambda&amp;1-\\lambda&amp;0\\\\-1+2\\lambda&amp;0&amp;1-\\lambda\\end{matrix}\\right|\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =1(0-(1-\\lambda)(-1+2\\lambda))-0+(1-\\lambda)((1-\\lambda)(1-\\lambda)-2(1+\\lambda))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-(1-\\lambda)(-1+2\\lambda)+(1-\\lambda)(\\lambda^2-4\\lambda-1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(1-\\lambda)(1-2\\lambda+\\lambda^2-4\\lambda-1)=(1-\\lambda)(\\lambda^2-6\\lambda)=\\lambda(1-\\lambda)(\\lambda-6).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda(1-\\lambda)(\\lambda-6) =0\\Rightarrow\\lambda_1=0,\\lambda_2=1,\\lambda_3=6.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_1=0:\\quad\\mathbf A-0\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;3&amp;1\\\\1&amp;4&amp;3\\end{pmatrix},\\quad x+2y+z=0\\;(1),\\;2x+3y+z=0\\;(2),\\;x+4y+3z=0\\;(3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(3)-(1):\\quad2y+2z =0\\Rightarrow z=-y,\\quad\\text{sub into (1): }x+y=0\\Rightarrow x=-y,\\quad\\therefore\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_2=1:\\quad\\mathbf A-\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;2&amp;1\\\\1&amp;4&amp;2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad2y+z=0\\;(1),\\;2x+2y+z=0\\;(2),\\;x+4y+2z=0\\;(3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\text{From (1): }2y+z =0\\Rightarrow -z=2y,\\quad\\text{sub into (2): }2x=0\\Rightarrow x=0,\\quad\\therefore\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_3=6:\\quad\\mathbf A-6\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}-5&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;-3&amp;1\\\\1&amp;4&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix},\\quad-5x+2y+z=0\\;(1),\\;2x-3y+z=0\\;(2),\\;x+4y-3z=0\\;(3)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(1)-(2):\\quad-7x+5y+z =0\\Rightarrow7x=5y\\Rightarrow y=\\tfrac75x,\\quad\\Rightarrow\\tfrac75x=y\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\text{sub into (3): }\\tfrac{33}{5}x-3z =0\\Rightarrow\\tfrac{11}{5}x=z,\\quad\\therefore\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\7\\\\11\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P =\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;5\\\\-1&amp;1&amp;7\\\\1&amp;-2&amp;11\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac1{30}\\begin{pmatrix}25&amp;-10&amp;-5\\\\18&amp;6&amp;-12\\\\1&amp;2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf A\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{30}\\begin{pmatrix}25&amp;-10&amp;-5\\\\18&amp;6&amp;-12\\\\1&amp;2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;3&amp;1\\\\1&amp;4&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;5\\\\-1&amp;1&amp;7\\\\1&amp;-2&amp;11\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{30}\\begin{pmatrix}25&amp;-10&amp;-5\\\\18&amp;6&amp;-12\\\\1&amp;2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;30\\\\0&amp;1&amp;42\\\\0&amp;-2&amp;66\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac1{30}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;30&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;180\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\therefore\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;5\\\\-1&amp;1&amp;7\\\\1&amp;-2&amp;11\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;6\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues and corresponding eigenvectors of matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Explain why this matrix cannot be diagonalised.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I) =(2-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)(3-\\lambda)=0\\Rightarrow\\lambda_1=2,\\lambda_2=3,\\lambda_3=3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_1=2:\\quad \\mathbf A-2\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad y=0\\;(1),\\;z=0\\;(3),\\quad\\therefore\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_2=\\lambda_3=3:\\quad\\mathbf A-3\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad -x+y=0\\;(1),\\;-y=0\\;(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\therefore x=y=0,\\quad\\mathbf v_2=\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\therefore\\lambda_1=2,\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ and }\\lambda_2=\\lambda_3=3,\\mathbf v_2=\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>We need 3 independent eigenvectors for a <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\times3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> matrix to be diagonalisable but we have only 2.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Find each of the following:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}^{6}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac12&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}^{9}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;b&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;c\\end{pmatrix}^{k}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a,b,c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}^{6}=\\begin{pmatrix}2^6&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;(-1)^6&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1^6\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}64&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac12&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}^{9}=\\begin{pmatrix}(\\frac12)^9&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;(-1)^9&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;(-2)^9\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac1{512}&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-512\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;b&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;c\\end{pmatrix}^{k}=\\begin{pmatrix}a^k&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;b^k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;c^k\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>The matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has eigenvalues <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1,1,3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with corresponding eigenvectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> respectively. Determine the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P =\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf A=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1},\\quad \\mathbf A^4=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^4\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P^{-1} =\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;-6&amp;2\\\\1&amp;3&amp;-1\\\\-1&amp;3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A^4 =\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}^{4}\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;-6&amp;2\\\\1&amp;3&amp;-1\\\\-1&amp;3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;81\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;-6&amp;2\\\\1&amp;3&amp;-1\\\\-1&amp;3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}6&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-80&amp;246&amp;80\\\\-240&amp;720&amp;246\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac13\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-40&amp;123&amp;40\\\\-120&amp;360&amp;123\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>The matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has eigenvalues <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-5,-1,1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with corresponding eigenvectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> respectively. Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^{10}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-6\\times5^9+\\frac65&amp;4\\times5^9+\\frac15&amp;2\\times5^9-\\frac25\\\\-3\\times5^9+\\frac35&amp;2\\times5^9-\\frac25&amp;5^9+\\frac45\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P =\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}-5&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf M^{10}=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^{10}\\mathbf P^{-1},\\quad\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2&amp;1\\\\6&amp;1&amp;-2\\\\-1&amp;-1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf M^{10} =\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}(-5)^{10}&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2&amp;1\\\\6&amp;1&amp;-2\\\\-1&amp;-1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-3\\times5^{10}&amp;2\\times5^{10}&amp;5^{10}\\\\6&amp;1&amp;-2\\\\-1&amp;-1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac15\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-6\\times5^{10}+6&amp;4\\times5^{10}+1&amp;2\\times5^{10}-2\\\\-3\\times5^{10}+3&amp;2\\times5^{10}-2&amp;5^{10}+4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-6\\times5^9+\\frac65&amp;4\\times5^9+\\frac15&amp;2\\times5^9-\\frac25\\\\-3\\times5^9+\\frac35&amp;2\\times5^9-\\frac25&amp;5^9+\\frac45\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Given that the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has eigenvalues <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_3=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with corresponding eigenvectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\2\\end{pmatrix},\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n\\to\\mathbf L\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf L\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P =\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac12&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac13&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf M\\mathbf P\\Rightarrow\\mathbf M=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D\\mathbf P^{-1}\\therefore\\mathbf M^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P^{-1} =\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf M^n =\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}(\\frac12)^n&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;(\\frac13)^n&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\-2&amp;1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-(\\frac12)^n&amp;0&amp;(\\frac12)^n\\\\-2(\\frac13)^n&amp;(\\frac13)^n&amp;(\\frac13)^n\\\\2&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\begin{pmatrix}2-(\\frac12)^n&amp;0&amp;(\\frac12)^n-1\\\\2-2(\\frac13)^n&amp;(\\frac13)^n&amp;(\\frac13)^n-1\\\\2-2(\\frac12)^n&amp;0&amp;2(\\frac12)^n-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\begin{pmatrix}2-\\frac1{2^n}&amp;0&amp;\\frac1{2^n}-1\\\\2-\\frac2{3^n}&amp;\\frac1{3^n}&amp;\\frac1{3^n}-1\\\\2-\\frac2{2^n}&amp;0&amp;\\frac2{2^n}-1\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf L=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mathbf M^n=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\begin{pmatrix}2-\\frac1{2^n}&amp;0&amp;\\frac1{2^n}-1\\\\2-\\frac2{3^n}&amp;\\frac1{3^n}&amp;\\frac1{3^n}-1\\\\2-\\frac2{2^n}&amp;0&amp;\\frac2{2^n}-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;0&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Given that the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has eigenvalues <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=1,\\lambda_2=\\frac34\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_3=\\frac15\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with eigenvectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M^n\\to\\mathbf L\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf L\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P =\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;-1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;\\frac34&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;\\frac15\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf M^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1},\\quad\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;3&amp;-3\\\\3&amp;-1&amp;-1\\\\-3&amp;-1&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf M^n =\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;-1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;(\\frac34)^n&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;(\\frac15)^n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;3&amp;-3\\\\3&amp;-1&amp;-1\\\\-3&amp;-1&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;1\\\\2&amp;-1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;3&amp;-3\\\\3(\\frac34)^n&amp;-(\\frac34)^n&amp;-(\\frac34)^n\\\\-3(\\frac15)^n&amp;-(\\frac15)^n&amp;5(\\frac15)^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}3+6(\\frac34)^n-\\frac3{5^n}&amp;3-2(\\frac34)^n-\\frac1{5^n}&amp;-3-2(\\frac34)^n-\\frac3{5^n}\\\\6-3(\\frac34)^n-\\frac3{5^n}&amp;6+(\\frac34)^n-\\frac1{5^n}&amp;-6+(\\frac34)^n-\\frac3{5^n}\\\\3+3(\\frac34)^n-\\frac6{5^n}&amp;3-(\\frac34)^n-\\frac2{5^n}&amp;-3-(\\frac34)^n-\\frac6{5^n}\\end{pmatrix}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf L=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mathbf M^n=\\frac16\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;3&amp;-3\\\\6&amp;6&amp;-6\\\\3&amp;3&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;2&amp;-2\\\\1&amp;1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}k&amp;0&amp;k\\\\0&amp;k&amp;0\\\\k&amp;0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a non-zero constant. Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^n=k^n\\begin{pmatrix}2^{n-1}&amp;0&amp;2^{n-1}\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\2^{n-1}&amp;0&amp;2^{n-1}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix} =\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}k-\\lambda&amp;0&amp;k\\\\0&amp;k-\\lambda&amp;0\\\\k&amp;0&amp;k-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I) =(k-\\lambda)^3-k^2(k-\\lambda)=(k-\\lambda)((k-\\lambda)^2-k^2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(k-\\lambda)(k^2-2k\\lambda+\\lambda^2-k^2)=\\lambda(k-\\lambda)(-2k+\\lambda)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda(k-\\lambda)(\\lambda-2k) =0\\Rightarrow\\lambda_1=0,\\lambda_2=k,\\lambda_3=2k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_1=0:\\quad\\mathbf A-0\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}k&amp;0&amp;k\\\\0&amp;k&amp;0\\\\k&amp;0&amp;k\\end{pmatrix},\\quad kx+kz=0\\;(1),\\;ky=0\\;(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\therefore z=-x,\\;y=0,\\quad\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_2=k:\\quad\\mathbf A-k\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;k\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\k&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad kz=0\\;(1),\\;kx=0\\;(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\therefore x=0,\\;z=0,\\quad\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lambda_3=2k:\\quad\\mathbf A-k\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}-k&amp;0&amp;k\\\\0&amp;-k&amp;0\\\\k&amp;0&amp;-k\\end{pmatrix},\\quad -kx+kz=0\\;(1),\\;-ky=0\\;(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\Rightarrow x=z,\\;y=0,\\quad\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf P^{-1} =\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf M^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;k^n&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;2^nk^n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =k^n\\begin{pmatrix}2^{n-1}&amp;0&amp;2^{n-1}\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\2^{n-1}&amp;0&amp;2^{n-1}\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ as req.}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.73-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}a-\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\\\a-b&amp;b&amp;-a+b\\\\-\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are non-zero positive constants and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&lt;b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1&lt;\\lambda_2&lt;\\lambda_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^n=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}2a^n-b^n&amp;b^n&amp;b^n-2a^n\\\\2a^n-2b^n&amp;2b^n&amp;2b^n-2a^n\\\\-b^n&amp;b^n&amp;b^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I =\\begin{pmatrix}a-\\frac b2-\\lambda&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\\\a-b&amp;b-\\lambda&amp;-a+b\\\\-\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I) =\\begin{vmatrix}a-\\frac b2-\\lambda&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\\\a-b&amp;b-\\lambda&amp;-a+b\\\\-\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2-\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}=\\begin{vmatrix}a-\\lambda&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\\\a-\\lambda&amp;b-\\lambda&amp;-a+b\\\\0&amp;\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2-\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\begin{vmatrix}a-\\lambda&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\\\0&amp;\\frac b2-\\lambda&amp;\\frac b2\\\\0&amp;\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2-\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}=\\begin{vmatrix}a-\\lambda&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\\\0&amp;-\\lambda&amp;\\lambda\\\\0&amp;\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2-\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\begin{vmatrix}a-\\lambda&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a\\\\0&amp;-\\lambda&amp;2\\lambda\\\\0&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}=(a-\\lambda)(\\lambda^2-b\\lambda)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\lambda(a-\\lambda)(\\lambda-b),\\quad\\therefore\\lambda_1=0,\\lambda_2=a,\\lambda_3=b.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\lambda_1=0:\\quad\\mathbf A-0\\mathbf I&amp;=\\begin{pmatrix}a-\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\\\a-b&amp;b&amp;-a+b\\\\-\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad (\\mathbf A-0\\mathbf I)\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\\\\\n\\left(a-\\frac b2\\right)x+\\frac b2y+\\left(-a+\\frac b2\\right)z&amp;=0\\;(1),\\quad(a-b)x+by+(-a+b)z=0\\;(2),\\quad-\\frac b2x+\\frac b2y+\\frac b2z=0\\;(3)\\\\\n(1)-(3):\\quad ax-az&amp;=0\\Rightarrow x=z,\\quad\\text{sub into (2): }by=0\\Rightarrow y=0,\\quad\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\\\\\n\\lambda_2=a:\\quad\\mathbf A-a\\mathbf I&amp;=\\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\\\a-b&amp;-a+b&amp;-a+b\\\\-\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad (\\mathbf A-a\\mathbf I)\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\\\\\n-\\frac b2x+\\frac b2y+\\left(-a+\\frac b2\\right)z&amp;=0\\;(1),\\quad(a-b)x+(-a+b)y+(-a+b)z=0\\;(2),\\quad-\\frac b2x+\\frac b2y+\\left(-a+\\frac b2\\right)z=0\\;(3)\\\\\n(1)-2(3):\\quad ax-ay+az&amp;=0\\Rightarrow x-y+z=0\\Rightarrow y=x+z,\\quad\\text{sub into (2): }(-2a+2b)z=0\\Rightarrow z=0,\\quad\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}.\\\\\n\\lambda_3=a:\\quad\\mathbf A-b\\mathbf I&amp;=\\begin{pmatrix}a-\\frac{3b}{2}&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-a+\\frac b2\\\\a-b&amp;0&amp;-a+b\\\\-\\frac b2&amp;\\frac b2&amp;-\\frac b2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad (\\mathbf A-b\\mathbf I)\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\\\\\n\\left(a-\\frac{3b}{2}\\right)x+\\frac b2y+\\left(-a+\\frac b2\\right)z&amp;=0\\;(1),\\quad(a-b)x+(-a+b)z=0\\;(2),\\quad-\\frac b2x+\\frac b2y-\\frac b2z=0\\;(3)\\\\\n(2):\\quad x&amp;=z,\\quad\\text{sub into (3): }\\frac12y-z=0\\Rightarrow y=2z,\\quad\\text{so }\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\\\\\n\\mathbf P&amp;=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;2\\\\1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;a&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;b\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf D=\\mathbf P^{-1}\\mathbf M\\mathbf P\\Rightarrow\\mathbf M^n=\\mathbf P\\mathbf D^n\\mathbf P^{-1}\\\\\n\\mathbf P^{-1}&amp;=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;0&amp;-2\\\\-1&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\n\\mathbf M^n&amp;=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;2\\\\1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;a^n&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;b^n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;0&amp;-2\\\\-1&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\n&amp;=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;2\\\\1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\2a^n&amp;0&amp;-2a^n\\\\-b^n&amp;b^n&amp;b^n\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\n&amp;=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}2a^n-b^n&amp;b^n&amp;b^n-2a^n\\\\2a^n-2b^n&amp;2b^n&amp;2b^n-2a^n\\\\-b^n&amp;b^n&amp;b^n\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ as req.}\n\\end{aligned}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]